      "message": "It is; In theory, we have 1 GiB of MMIO so sharing \"everything\" wouldn\u0027t be viable. See b/245267332 for a better approach. I think we can still keep it as-is today but know that there\u0027s some tech/security debt, hence merging the TODO.",
